{
 "_about": "Topic subsection for the 360 technical questions of the priručnik's six mock exams. The vocabulary is exactly the one parse2.py reads off the HRS technical bank's own chapter headings; nothing new is invented. Classified from the question STEM (and, where the stem is a bare figure caption, from the subject matter of all four options -- never from which option is correct).",
 "_rules": [
  "A question that refers to another by number ('iz zadatka 47', 'kao u pitanju 19') takes its anchor's subsection, so chains stay in one packet.",
  "Where a book question's stem matches an HRS question exactly, HRS's own subsection wins over any judgement of mine. All 57 such twins agreed with the hand classification.",
  "Modulation theory and properties go to 3 (Krugovi), following HRS, which files every AM/FM/SSB/CW question there. Transmitter STAGES -- buffer, driver, multiplier, PA, limiter, Pi-network, efficiency -- go to 5.",
  "Harmonic arithmetic goes to 3; a harmonic landing in another service's band goes to 9.",
  "Only the 360 technical questions are classified. The propisi and pravila banks carry no chapter headings in the HRS source, so those 456+240+120 questions have subsection null on the HRS side too -- there is no existing vocabulary to draw from, and inventing one would be exactly the misfiling the item warns against."
 ],
 "_unset": {
  "bk-teh-4-13": "Stem survives OCR only as 'Z, - Z=som |'; the question is a bare figure with four impedance options. Nothing in the text says which topic it belongs to, so it is left unset rather than guessed from its neighbours."
 },
